    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were enjoying a peaceful camping night in a mountain shrouded in silence and darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633580/extras/5a228ea4afaa346b9c824a840ef0346d.avif?t=1755044502\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The warm glow of the campfire cast flickering shadows when, suddenly, your eyes caught sight of something unnatural.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633580/extras/d6f93265cd0e1e1879e91437831aa830.avif?t=1755044502\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The only thing I have at hand is an unreliable lamp. To reveal its identity, you step deep into the mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3633580/extras/dbf1452d4cc2530b360e99bd0c7f0c24.avif?t=1755044502\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a walking simulator horror game where you explore a dark mountain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Provisions for Streaming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Users are permitted to stream videos or live content using this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monetization is also allowed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disclaimer</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are not responsible for any issues arising from streaming or gameplay related to this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning Regarding Psychological Effects</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > This game contains horror elements that may induce feelings of fear or anxiety. Play at your own risk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25efGame Content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main story + bonus content (unlocked upon completing the main story)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated completion time: 5 minutes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500</p>",
